 ("12. Severability.", ["If any provision of the Services Agreement or these Terms and Conditions shall be held to be invalid or unenforceable, such invalidity or unenforceability shall attach only to such provision and shall not in any way affect or render invalid or unenforceable any other provision of the Services Agreement and these Terms and Conditions, and the Services Agreement and these Terms and Conditions shall be carried out as if such invalid or unenforceable provision were not contained herein. It is the intention of the Parties that if any such provision is held to be illegal, invalid or unenforceable, there will be added in lieu thereof a provision as similar in terms to such provision as possible and be legal, valid and enforceable."]),
